# nangate_legalize_blocks: vedic_16x16's blocks as a ring around adder A3 --
# the multipliers in the four corners, A3 in the middle, the other two adders
# between the multipliers on the left and right.  No cut can split this into
# two parts without cutting a block, so slicing cannot place it; the block
# legalizer must, with A3 near the centre of the box.
vedic_16x16	V11	0.22	0.78
vedic_16x16	V12	0.78	0.78
vedic_16x16	V10	0.22	0.22
vedic_16x16	V9	0.78	0.22
vedic_16x16	A3	0.50	0.50
vedic_16x16	A4	0.50	0.88
vedic_16x16	A5	0.50	0.12
# and vedic_8x8 (four copies) with its own logic asked for in the middle: the
# legalizer keeps half its free area there for the cell pass, no blocks on it
vedic_8x8	*	0.50	0.50
